\noindent canonique $L^\Delta_{B/A}\otimes_B B'\longrightarrow L^\Delta_{B'/A'}$ , d'où la conclusion.

\vspace{5bp}
\phantomsection\hypertarget{illusie:I:ch1:p128:remark-1.2.6.4}{}%
