(I 3.1.8 (ii)') of $\operatorname{D}(A\text{-Alg}/B)$ as the category of right fractions of $\operatorname{Hotfib}(A\text{-Alg}/B)$,
it suffices, by (I 1.4.4), to show that, for every A-algebra $C$ fibered over $B$,
the pro-object of $\operatorname{D.}(B)$

