\vspace{5bp}
\phantomsection\hypertarget{ILL-CCD:LNM239:CH3:S1:1:2:eq1:def}{}%
the subcategory of \uline{$\operatorname{Exal}$} formed by the $A$-extensions, whose arrows are the arrows 
\phantomsection\hypertarget{ILL-CCD:LNM239:CH3:S1:1:2:fixed-ring-map}{}%
of extensions inducing the identity on $A$. For a morphism of rings $A\longrightarrow B$\par

