where the bottom row is $Y$ and the top row $\operatorname{diff}(\operatorname{alg}(Y))$; hence\par

\phantomsection\hypertarget{ILL-CCD:LNM239:CH3:S1:1:9:proof:conclusion}{}%
\noindent\hspace*{1.5bp}$Y\xrightarrow{\sim}\operatorname{diff}(\operatorname{alg}(Y))$, which completes the proof.\par

