\phantomsection\hypertarget{ILL-CCD:LNM239:CH3:S1:1:9:1:rem}{}%
\uline{Remark} 1.1.9.1. In fact we have shown that, under the hypotheses of (1.1.9), the 
\phantomsection\hypertarget{ILL-CCD:LNM239:CH3:S1:1:9:1:rem:quasi-inverse}{}%
functors alg and diff (between the category \uline{$\operatorname{Exal}$}\!$_A(C,-)$ and the category of 
$C$-extensions of $\Omega^1_{C/A}$ by a variable $C$-module) are quasi-inverse to one another.\par


\vspace{5bp}
\phantomsection\hypertarget{ILL-CCD:LNM239:CH3:S1:1:10:para}{}%
\noindent\hspace*{0.7bp}1.1.10.\quad Let\par

