\noindent\hspace*{160.0bp}\IllusieFundamentalInverseHZeroSPOneSixtySeven\par

\vspace{5bp}
\noindent d'où\par

\vspace{5bp}
\phantomsection\hypertarget{ILL-CCD:LNM239:CH3:S1:2:3:proof:alpha-beta:derived-inverse}{}%
\noindent\hspace*{151.0bp}\IllusieFundamentalInverseDerivedInversePOneSixtySeven\par

\vspace{5bp}
\noindent d'où\par

\vspace{5bp}
\phantomsection\hypertarget{ILL-CCD:LNM239:CH3:S1:2:3:proof:alpha-beta:final}{}%
\noindent\hspace*{136.0bp}\IllusieFundamentalInverseFinalPOneSixtySeven\par

\vspace{5bp}
\phantomsection\hypertarget{ILL-CCD:LNM239:CH3:S1:2:3:proof:conclusion}{}%
ce qui prouve $\alpha\beta=\operatorname{id}$ et achève la démonstration de (1.2.3).\par


\vspace{5bp}
\phantomsection\hypertarget{ILL-CCD:LNM239:CH3:S1:2:4:para}{}%
