\uline{sur} $B$ \uline{s'identifie canoniquement à}\quad \IllusieFlatAutomorphismGroupPOneEightySeven\ ($\simeq$\,\IllusieFlatAutomorphismExtPOneEightySeven\par

\noindent (II 1.2.4.3)).
