(ii)\quad \uline{When} $\omega(\uline{B},f_o)=0$, \uline{the set of isomorphism classes of flat deformations} 
\uline{of} $C_o$ \uline{over} $B$ \uline{is a torsor under the group}\quad \IllusieFlatTorsorGroupPOneEightySeven\par

\noindent ($\simeq$\IllusieFlatTorsorExtPOneEightySeven\ (1.2.3)).
